        <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Cosmic-initial-setup Dependencies</bridgehead>
          <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Required</bridgehead>

            <para>rustc, cargo-c, libinput, pulseaudio, polkit, libxkbcommon, and cosmic-icons</para>
    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-initial-setup</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-initial-setup for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="pre">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --profile release --frozen</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-initial-setup \
        /usr/bin/cosmic-initial-setup &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 res/*.desktop /usr/share/applications/ &amp;&amp;

install -vdm755 /etc/xdg/autostart &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 res/com.system76.CosmicInitialSetup.Autostart.desktop \
  /etc/xdg/autostart/com.system76.CosmicInitialSetup.desktop &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 res/icon.svg \
  /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/com.system76.CosmicInitialSetup.svg &amp;&amp;

install -vdm755 /usr/share/cosmic-layouts &amp;&amp;

cp -rv res/layouts/* /usr/share/cosmic-layouts &amp;&amp;

install -vdm755 /usr/share/cosmic-themes &amp;&amp;

cp -rv res/themes/* /usr/share/cosmic-themes</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

      <sect2 role="content">
        <title>Contents of Cosmic-initial-setup</title>

